  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">India: Infrastructure Loan Fund - Small loans to bridge the infrastructure gap for the poor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme is expected to directly result in access to new/import infrastructure services such as electricity, sewage and transport to an estimated 280,000 people.To  improve access to better quality transport, clean energy and basic urban services for households and businesses, by providing loans to private sector-led infrastructure projects. This will benefit an estimated 280,000 people with improved infrastructure services.</narrative>
  </description>
